  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/672/stoneborn_text.png\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> STONEBORN 是一款簡潔獨特的介面改版，靈感源自奇幻風格媒體。視覺舒適、點綴精緻且整體風格一致，無論原版還是模組化遊玩都能完美搭配。</span> </span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em> 前方充滿危險，下次冒險就帶上 STONEBORN 吧！</em> </span></strong></span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" height=\"32\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">探索其他 STONEBORN 資源包：</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-dwarven-fantasy-inspired-ui-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-dwarven-fantasy-inspired-gear-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/410/445/cfgear.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-odds-ends\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/635/439/638037127677161946.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\">&nbsp;</a></span></p>\n<p><br> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">關於重新上傳與相容其他模組的重要條款：</span></span></strong></em></span></div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">請切勿重新上傳本資源包檔案，無論是在 Planet Minecraft、CurseForge 或其他任何託管或論壇頁面。如需向他人推薦或連結此資源包，請直接連結至此 CurseForge 頁面。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">請勿宣稱擁有此資源包或將其偽裝為自己的作品。若需在別處推薦或連結此資源包，請務必給予適當的署名（Sindavar）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">您可以建立或編輯資源包中的素材，以與其他模組的介面相容。然而，這些資源包僅能包含所替換模組的相關素材，不得包含基礎 STONEBORN 材質包。（您的模組相容支援包需作為 STONEBORN 的覆蓋層載入）</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">您可以自由託管這些相容包，但請將 STONEBORN 頁面列為必要依賴項，並完整附上我的署名。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">您不得將 STONEBORN 與其他資源包打包後，重新上傳至 CurseForge 或其他平台。我理解這對伺服器等情況帶來便利，但這會影響本頁面的收益與下載量。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">您可以為個人用途編輯或建立 STONEBORN 的素材，但這些修改後的檔案不得以任何形式重新上傳。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">若您對上述任何條款有疑問，或對於重新上傳、編輯資源包有任何問題，歡迎隨時聯繫我。若發現任何未經授權的重傳、錯誤署名或違反上述條款的情況，也請告知我。</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" height=\"32\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-style:italic\">開發者備註：</span></strong></em></span></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">我持續尋求改進作品，非常歡迎對本資源包的建議。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">使用非英文語言可能會導致部分文字元素無法顯示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">本資源包將（希望）持續維護至 1.17 之後的未來 Minecraft 版本，但不支援舊版遊戲。<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">歡迎在下方留言區回報遇到的任何問題，非常感謝您的關注 :)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有任何問題嗎？請在 Discord 私訊我或加入 Discord 伺服器詢問！<br>- Sindavar<br></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" height=\"32\"> </span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">在其他平台支持我並加入 Discord：</span></em></span></strong></span></h1>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Sindavar33\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/345/twitter.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fsindavart%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/342/ig.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fsindavar%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/344/pmc.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\">&nbsp;</a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Sindavar\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/343/patreon.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"> </a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/MF2z3KZp8Z\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/341/discord.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"> </a> </span><br> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fstoneborn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e367a0c4-0cf1-4832-bf34-643c5b8f0742.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\"> </a></span><br> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" height=\"32\"></p>",
